OL,3,GNEWSAFly-tipping rises while few
OL,4,Aoffenders face action
OL,5,
OL,6,FFly-tipping in Coventry is around 40%
OL,7,Fhigher than before the Covid-19
OL,8,Fpandemic, while only 3% of cases have
OL,9,Fled to enforcement action or
OL,10,Fprosecution, councillors have heard.
OL,12,FThe figures were discussed at a meeting
OL,13,Fof the council's Scrutiny Co-ordination
OL,14,FCommittee, which reviewed a report
OL,15,Foutlining efforts to tackle the
OL,16,Fproblem.
OL,18,FMeasures include the deployment of
OL,19,Fcompliance officers, neighbourhood
OL,20,Fsupport officers and targeted CCTV
OL,21,Fcameras to identify offenders.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
