OL,3,GNEWSAFly-tipping rises while few
OL,4,Aoffenders face action
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leader George Duggins said one
OL,7,Fof his priorities this year was to "go
OL,8,Fheavier and harder" on prosecutions for
OL,9,Ffly-tipping offences.
